flowchart TB
    U[Usuarios] --> CF[CloudFront HTTPS]
    CF --> S3F[S3 Frontend privado]
    U --> ALB[Application Load Balancer HTTPS]
    ALB --> EC2[EC2 Docker Backend FastAPI]
    EC2 --> RDS[RDS PostgreSQL privado]
    EC2 --> S3A[S3 Artefactos versionado]
    EC2 --> AI[AI Engine local offline]
    EC2 --> WS[WebSocket colaborativo]
    R53[Route53 dominio propio] --> CF
    R53 --> ALB
    CW[CloudWatch Logs] <-- EC2
